; ============================================================
; MainMenu.tscn — Run 164 "Ink & Washi" rebuild
; ============================================================
; Structure only. Every colour, font, stylebox and seal is applied
; at runtime by UISkin.skin_main_menu() so there is exactly one
; source of truth for the look (scripts/ui/UISkin.gd).
;
; Node names MainMenu.gd depends on are unchanged:
;   CenterStack/StartButton · CenterStack/ControlsButton
;   CenterStack/QuitButton  · ControlsOverlay/Panel/CloseButton
;   ControlsOverlay/Panel/OverlayTitle · .../ControlsBody
; ============================================================

